{"name":"原版立绘","asset":{"key":"illust:illust_teatan_fighter_b","skin":null},"stage":null}],"costumes":[],"weapons":[],"profile":{"Age":[18],"Height":[129],"Weight":[28]},"tribes":["泰坦人"],"story":"布莱德，泰坦族中擅长交战的变形超级泰坦人，即超级泰坦人2搏击选手。\n\n在家教严厉的家庭中成长的布莱德，经常被禁止出门，只能待在房里独自专注一些事，却机缘巧合地让他掌握了变身技能。\n\n身材娇小的泰坦人布莱德，变身之后威力增强，但速度丝毫不受影响。快速向敌人突进，连续击出重拳。不参与战斗时，性格比较温顺。","storyKey":"profile_teatan_fighter_b_story","sources":{"hero":"heroes.json / OriginId=214","profile":"heroprofile.json / OriginId=214","strings":"strings-zhCN.json","items":"items.json / TargetCharacterIds, ExclusiveCharacterId","voiceLines":["strings-zhCN.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-enUS.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-jaJP.json / Voice_*, cv_*"]},"voiceLines":[{"id":"teatan_fighter_b","label":"普通","lines":[{"type":"TouchReactionGood1","label":"触碰反应-积极1","texts":{"zhCN":["我是布莱德！本届泰坦国格斗锦标赛总冠军！"],"enUS":["I'm Blade! The current TFC champion!"],"jaJP":["僕はコブシ！今のTFCチャンピオンだ！"]},"keys":["Voice_teatan_fighter_b_1_TouchReactionGood1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionGood2","label":"触碰反应-积极2","texts":{"zhCN":["只要我们联手，就能打败所有人。"],"enUS":["We can beat anyone if we combine our powers."],"jaJP":["僕たちが力を合わせれば誰にも負けない"]},"keys":["Voice_teatan_fighter_b_1_TouchReactionGood2"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad1","label":"触碰反应-消极1","texts":{"zhCN":["暴龙这家伙，竟然掉以轻心。"],"enUS":["Dragon, being caught off guard."],"jaJP":["タカシの野郎、油断するなんて"]},"keys":["Voice_teatan_fighter_b_1_TouchReactionBad1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad2","label":"触碰反应-消极2","texts":{"zhCN":["我不需要你帮忙！有了这个…我就能成为第一！"],"enUS":["I don't need help from you! With this... I'll be the best!"],"jaJP":["助けなんかいらない！これで…僕は最強になる！"]},"keys":["Voice_teatan_fighter_b_1_TouchReactionBad2"]},{"type":"NoticeMail","label":"邮件提示","texts":{"zhCN":["呃，这次也没碰到。邮递员到底是什么时候来的啊？！"],"enUS":["Ugh, I missed again. When did the mailman drop by?!"],"jaJP":["あっ、今度も逃がしたか…郵便配達員は何時も何処に現れるんだ？"]},"keys":["Voice_teatan_fighter_b_1_NoticeMail"]}]}]}
